  "description": "Multi-format text extraction and RAG preparation library for .NET — PDF, DOCX, PPTX, Excel, HTML, Markdown, JSON, YAML, CSV, EML, MSG, ODT, RTF, EPUB, ZIP, and more. Includes RAG chunking with provenance, table-mode control, and a fluent DI builder. Includes Tesseract OCR for images and scanned PDFs (Windows x64/x86) and AI-ingestion safety gates.",
